      "originalScript": "ಎಡಗೈಯಲ್ಲಿ ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಮಂತ್ರಾಕ್ಷತೆಯನ್ನ ಹಾಕಿಕೊಂಡು ಎಡಗೈ ಮೇಲೆ ಬಲಗೈಯನ್ನ ಇಟ್ಟುಕೊಂಡು ಬಲದ ತೊಡೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಇಟ್ಟುಕೊಳ್ಳಿ śubhe śobhane muhūrte ādya brahmaṇaḥ dvitīya parārdhe śrī śvetavarāha kalpe vaivasvata manvantare aṣṭāviṁśatitame kaliyuge prathamapāde\nbhāratavarṣe bharatakhaṇḍe daṇḍakāraṇye godāvaryāḥ dakṣiṇe tīre śālivāhana śake bhautāvatāre rāmakṣetre\nasmin vartamāne prabhavādi ṣaṣṭi saṁvatsarāṇāṁ madhye śubhe viśvāvasu nāma saṁvatsare dakṣiṇāyane śaradṛtau āśvījamāse śuklapakṣe saptamyāṁ\nvāsara vāsarastu induvāsarayuktāyāṁ mūlanakṣatrayuktāyāṁ śubhanakṣatra śubhayoga śubhakaraṇa evaṁguṇa sakalaviśeṣaṇa viśiṣṭāyāṁ śubhatithau\nbhāratīramaṇa mukhyaprāṇa antargata śrī vedavyāsa preraṇayā śrī vedavyāsa prītyarthaṁ pustakeṣu sannihita sarasvatyātmaka śrī vyāsa paraśurāma āvāhana pūjāṁ pratiṣṭhāpana pūjāṁ kariṣye\n",
      "sourceOriginal": "ಎಡಗೈಯಲ್ಲಿ ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಮಂತ್ರಾಕ್ಷತೆಯನ್ನ ಹಾಕಿಕೊಂಡು ಎಡಗೈ ಮೇಲೆ ಬಲಗೈಯನ್ನ ಇಟ್ಟುಕೊಂಡು ಬಲದ ತೊಡೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಇಟ್ಟುಕೊಳ್ಳಿ śubhe śobhane muhūrte ādya brahmaṇaḥ dvitīya parārdhe śrī śvetavarāha kalpe vaivasvata manvantare aṣṭāviṁśatitame kaliyuge prathamapāde\nbhāratavarṣe bharatakhaṇḍe daṇḍakāraṇye godāvaryāḥ dakṣiṇe tīre śālivāhana śake bhautāvatāre rāmakṣetre\nasmin vartamāne prabhavādi ṣaṣṭi saṁvatsarāṇāṁ madhye śubhe viśvāvasu nāma saṁvatsare dakṣiṇāyane śaradṛtau āśvījamāse śuklapakṣe saptamyāṁ\nvāsara vāsarastu induvāsarayuktāyāṁ mūlanakṣatrayuktāyāṁ śubhanakṣatra śubhayoga śubhakaraṇa evaṁguṇa sakalaviśeṣaṇa viśiṣṭāyāṁ śubhatithau\nbhāratīramaṇa mukhyaprāṇa antargata śrī vedavyāsa preraṇayā śrī vedavyāsa prītyarthaṁ pustakeṣu sannihita sarasvatyātmaka śrī vyāsa paraśurāma āvāhana pūjāṁ pratiṣṭhāpana pūjāṁ kariṣye\n",
      "sourceRoman": "eḍagaiyalli svalpa maṁtrākṣateyanna hākikoṁḍu eḍagai mēle balagaiyanna iṭṭukoṁḍu balada toḍeyalli iṭṭukoḷḷi śubhe śobhane muhūrte ādya brahmaṇaḥ dvitīya parārdhe śrī śvetavarāha kalpe vaivasvata manvantare aṣṭāviṁśatitame kaliyuge prathamapāde\nbhāratavarṣe bharatakhaṇḍe daṇḍakāraṇye godāvaryāḥ dakṣiṇe tīre śālivāhana śake bhautāvatāre rāmakṣetre\nasmin vartamāne prabhavādi ṣaṣṭi saṁvatsarāṇāṁ madhye śubhe viśvāvasu nāma saṁvatsare dakṣiṇāyane śaradṛtau āśvījamāse śuklapakṣe saptamyāṁ\nvāsara vāsarastu induvāsarayuktāyāṁ mūlanakṣatrayuktāyāṁ śubhanakṣatra śubhayoga śubhakaraṇa evaṁguṇa sakalaviśeṣaṇa viśiṣṭāyāṁ śubhatithau\nbhāratīramaṇa mukhyaprāṇa antargata śrī vedavyāsa preraṇayā śrī vedavyāsa prītyarthaṁ pustakeṣu sannihita sarasvatyātmaka śrī vyāsa paraśurāma āvāhana pūjāṁ pratiṣṭhāpana pūjāṁ kariṣye\n",
