      "originalScript": "ಮಂತ್ರಾಕ್ಷತೆಯನ್ನು ತೊಕೊಂಡು ನಿನ್ನೆ ಪೂಜೆ ಮಾಡಿರುವ ಪುಸ್ತಕ ಮಂಡಲಕ್ಕೆ ಮತ್ತೆ ಪೂಜೆಯನ್ನು ಮಾಡಿರಿ.\nkapilāya namaḥ kapilam āvāhayāmi\ndattātreyāya namaḥ dattātreyam āvāhayāmi\nhayagrīvāya namaḥ hayagrīvam āvāhayāmi\noṁ rāmāya namaḥ rāmam āvāhayāmi\noṁ kṛṣṇāya namaḥ kṛṣṇam āvāhayāmi\noṁ paraśurāmāya namaḥ paraśurāmam āvāhayāmi\nvedavyāsāya namaḥ vedavyāsam āvāhayāmi\nnārāyaṇāya namaḥ nārāyaṇam āvāhayāmi\nśriyai mahālakṣmīm āvāhayāmi bhūdevīm āvāhayāmi durgāṁ āvāhayāmi\nmukhya prāṇam āvāhayāmi sarasvatīm āvāhayāmi bhāratīm āvāhayāmi\nಮಂತ್ರಾಕ್ಷತೆಯನ್ನು ಹಾಕ್ತಾ ಬನ್ನಿರಿ.\nbhāratīm āvāhayāmi śeṣam āvāhayāmi\nrudram āvāhayāmi pārvatīm āvāhayāmi vināyakam āvāhayāmi\nsakalaṛṣigaṇaṁ siddhapuruṣaṁ munigaṇaṁ āvāhayāmi\n",
      "romanText": "maṁtrākṣateyannu tokoṁḍu ninne pūje māḍiruva pustaka maṁḍalakke matte pūjeyannu māḍiri.\nkapilāya namaḥ kapilam āvāhayāmi\ndattātreyāya namaḥ dattātreyam āvāhayāmi\nhayagrīvāya namaḥ hayagrīvam āvāhayāmi\noṁ rāmāya namaḥ rāmam āvāhayāmi\noṁ kṛṣṇāya namaḥ kṛṣṇam āvāhayāmi\noṁ paraśurāmāya namaḥ paraśurāmam āvāhayāmi\nvedavyāsāya namaḥ vedavyāsam āvāhayāmi\nnārāyaṇāya namaḥ nārāyaṇam āvāhayāmi\nśriyai mahālakṣmīm āvāhayāmi bhūdevīm āvāhayāmi durgāṁ āvāhayāmi\nmukhya prāṇam āvāhayāmi sarasvatīm āvāhayāmi bhāratīm āvāhayāmi\nmaṁtrākṣateyannu hāktā banniri.\nbhāratīm āvāhayāmi śeṣam āvāhayāmi\nrudram āvāhayāmi pārvatīm āvāhayāmi vināyakam āvāhayāmi\nsakalaṛṣigaṇaṁ siddhapuruṣaṁ munigaṇaṁ āvāhayāmi\n",
