      "originalScript": "ಹೀಗೆ ಒಂದೊಂದು ಹೂವಾಗಿ ಅಂಗ ಪೂಜೆ ಅರ್ಚನೆ ಮಾಡ್ತಾ ಬನ್ನಿರಿ.\nbrahmāṇyai namaḥ pādau pūjayāmi\njagaddhātryai namaḥ gulphau pūjayāmi\njagadvatsalāyai namaḥ jaṅghe pūjayāmi\njagatpūjyāyai namaḥ jānunī pūjayāmi\ncāruvilāsinyai namaḥ ūrū pūjayāmi\nnārāyaṇapriyāyai namaḥ kaṭiṁ pūjayāmi\njanmahīnāyai namaḥ jaghanaṁ pūjayāmi\ngambhīranābhaye namaḥ nābhiṁ pūjayāmi\ngaruḍaśeṣarudramātre namaḥ udaraṁ pūjayāmi\nlokamātre namaḥ stanau pūjayāmi\nviśālavakṣase namaḥ vakṣasthalaṁ pūjayāmi\ngānavicakṣaṇāyai namaḥ kaṇṭhaṁ pūjayāmi\nskandādidevapūjyāyai namaḥ skandhau pūjayāmi\ncaturbhujāyai namaḥ bāhūn pūjayāmi\npustakadhāriṇyai namaḥ hanuṁ pūjayāmi\nśrotriyabāndhavāyai namaḥ śrotre pūjayāmi\nsarvavedoddhāriṇyai namaḥ vaktraṁ pūjayāmi\nbimbasamānauṣṭhyai namaḥ oṣṭhau pūjayāmi\nsunāsāyai namaḥ nāsikāṁ pūjayāmi\nkamalacakṣuṣe namaḥ netre pūjayāmi\ntilakadhāriṇyai namaḥ phālaṁ pūjayāmi\nanekacandrakāntaye namaḥ keśān pūjayāmi\nsarvābhīṣṭadātre namaḥ śiraḥ pūjayāmi\nsarasvatyai namaḥ sarvāṅgaṁ pūjayāmi\n",
